<section class="content">

<h3>Section 5: Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, you who created me in your image,<br />
help me to know myself as you see me.<br />
Heal the wounds that darken your image in me,<br />
and teach me to see your face in every person I meet.<br />
Through Christ, who reveals me to myself,<br />
may I live always according to my dignity as your child,<br />
and never forget that I was created by love, for love,<br />
destined for eternal beatitude with you.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

<p><strong>Your own prayer:</strong> Write a short prayer asking for the grace to live according to your dignity this week.</p>
